<div class="instructions__root">
    <p class="instructions__p">点击或轻触屏幕，启动三列灵感转盘 <span class="instructions__symbol">🎲</span>。</p>
    <p class="instructions__p">再次点击可逐列停下。三列出现相同图案，就会解锁一条灵感提示 <span class="instructions__symbol">✨</span>。</p>
    <p class="instructions__p">打开灵感组合面板，可以查看不同图案对应的提示主题 <span class="instructions__symbol">🏆</span>。</p>
    <p class="instructions__p" id="vibrationInstructions">底部按钮可切换声音 <span class="instructions__symbol">🔊</span> 和触感反馈。</p>

    <button class="instructions__button" id="playButton">开始抽取</button>
</div>
